# Issue #2697 proposal 3 (greenfield flag day): document create and link-set
# acknowledgements and the attachment bind carry hashes instead of echoing the
# signed event, manifest, state, content-key bundle, KEK targets, write header,
# and write authorization. Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main
# contains the new contract.
